               PERFORM REFRESH-ROOF-TYPE-0003.
               PERFORM EXPAND-HOUSE-TYPE-0004.
               PERFORM AUDIT-TAX-BAND-0005.
               PERFORM CHECK-TAX-BAND-0006.
               PERFORM SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0007.
               PERFORM NORMALISE-WITH-PROFITS-0008.
               PERFORM CHECK-REG-NUMBER-0009.
